<title>USA: Golden West Financial Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Golden West Financial Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>OAKLAND, Calif. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dec. 31, 1996     Q4     Dec. 31, 1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.32		    $1.14</p>
<p> Net			 75,950		   66,664</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  57,312		   58,716</p>
<p>					    YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.84		    $4.00</p>
<p> Net			164,671		  234,539</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  57,989		   58,657</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year 1996 includes a charge of $205.2 million, or $3.49/shr for changes in accounting for goodwill. Excluding this charge, net income would have been $369.9 million, or $6.33/shr.</p>
